Milestone 5, the BUG-40 case (2026-10-16), the same binary and directory:
  b40      mmpre.muskrat.pre mmb40.mink.pre 2 0 1 -case 2 -f 8               (+ .forecast)
  b40rank  mmpre.muskrat.pre mmb40.mink.pre 2 0 1 -case 2 -lrtest
The port reads the .pre files through fue's cast, which truncates a rational
term's nu(B) at 40 lags (BUG-40); the C applies the exact filter. On b40 the
step's tail reaches 0.46, the logL moves by 0.47 and the rank test's verdict
at 10% flips; tests/test_m5.py checks the port against these files fed the
oracle's component (tests/cdet.py), and the difference on fue's.
